WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:23.447
Coby: Is Jim coming yet?

2
00:00:23.448 --> 00:00:27.012
Kara: I don't see him.

3
00:00:27.013 --> 00:00:31.603
Jenna: Wait until he hears that we had a car wash.

4
00:00:31.604 --> 00:00:35.161
Daisy: And a bake sale.

5
00:00:35.162 --> 00:00:38.400
Greg: And a clothing collection!

6
00:00:38.401 --> 00:00:43.453
Mark: He's going to be really surprised.

7
00:00:43.454 --> 00:00:45.329
Maya: And he'll be touched.

8
00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:49.410
Maya: That means you feel happy right here.

9
00:00:49.411 --> 00:00:59.587
Kara: We sure bought his family a lot of stuff!

10
00:00:59.588 --> 00:01:02.936
Ted: Where are they living now, Miss Gray?

11
00:01:02.937 --> 00:01:04.684
Miss Gray: In an apartment.

12
00:01:04.685 --> 00:01:10.229
Miss Gray: They'll stay there until their house is fixed.

13
00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:12.946
Kara: But when is Jim going to get here?

14
00:01:12.947 --> 00:01:15.970
Miss Gray: Soon.

15
00:01:15.971 --> 00:01:19.132
Mark: It's so hard to wait.

16
00:01:19.133 --> 00:01:21.527
Miss Gray: I know.

17
00:01:21.528 --> 00:01:24.145
That's why we're going to read a book.

18
00:01:24.146 --> 00:01:29.128
Class: Yay! Swamp Monster Baseball!

19
00:01:29.129 --> 00:01:33.858
Miss Gray: Once there was a swamp monster who . . .

20
00:01:33.859 --> 00:01:41.409
Miss Gray: The swamp monster swung his bat and—

21
00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:44.403
Class: Jim! Mrs. Reed!

22
00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:46.736
Jim: Hi, everybody!

23
00:01:46.737 --> 00:01:49.349
Miss Gray: Welcome back, Jim.

24
00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:51.644
Ted: Is your house fixed yet?

25
00:01:51.645 --> 00:01:55.812
Mrs. Reed: No. It's going to take a long time.

26
00:01:55.813 --> 00:01:58.827
Mark: Well, we wanted to help your family.

27
00:01:58.828 --> 00:02:02.071
Jenna: So we had a bake sale and a car wash!

28
00:02:02.072 --> 00:02:07.904
Kara: And we bought you all this stuff.

29
00:02:07.905 --> 00:02:14.852
Jim: Wow! Thank you!

30
00:02:14.853 --> 00:02:17.881
Mrs. Reed: What nice friends you have, Jim.

31
00:02:17.882 --> 00:02:19.081
Jim: I know.

32
00:02:19.082 --> 00:02:21.488
Room Two is the . . .

33
00:02:21.489 --> 00:02:24.603
Class: Best!
